\par}{\centering 图1. 1 某型飞机外形检测的多系统协同测量场景

\par}\section{基于任务相似性的测量序列规划\label{mark-3.1}}

\subsection{测量任务集合多层级划分\label{mark-3.2.1}}

(1)	若以串行序列执行测量任务时,将会产生过多的等待时间,因此应该尽可能多规划测量任务的并行序列来有效地提高测量效率。

因而可知,测量设备的优先级最高,测量站位次之,测量基准由于可以同时被占用使得其优先级最低。\foreignlanguage{english}{对于任意的两个测量任务}$T_{i}$\foreignlanguage{english}{和}$T_{j}$\foreignlanguage{english}{,测量要素可能相同或完全不同,则可通过一个三位二进制数}$B_{ij}$\foreignlanguage{english}{来表示：}

$B_{ij}=b_{MD}^{ij}b_{MS}^{ij}b_{MB}^{ij}$	(3.1)

\foreignlanguage{english}{其中,}$B_{ij}$\foreignlanguage{english}{从高位到低位依次对应测量设备、测量站位和测量基准的相同与否。测量要素相同时,}$b_{k}^{ij}$\foreignlanguage{english}{为1,否则为0。}

\foreignlanguage{english}{将}$B_{ij}$\foreignlanguage{english}{转化为十进制数}$d_{ij}=2^{2}*b_{MD}^{ij}+2*b_{MS}^{ij}+b_{MB}^{ij}$\foreignlanguage{english}{,且}$d_{ij}^{\prime}=b_{MD}^{ij}+b_{MS}^{ij}+b_{MB}^{ij}$\foreignlanguage{english}{,基于拉普拉斯核函数量化测量任务的相似性}$s_{ij}$\foreignlanguage{english}{：}

$s_{ij}=1-(1-\frac{d_{ij}^{\prime}}{3})e^{-{d_{ij}}}$	(3.2)

\foreignlanguage{english}{进而构造出测量任务集合}$T$\foreignlanguage{english}{的相似性矩阵}$S$\foreignlanguage{english}{：}

$S=\left[\begin{array}{cccc}
s_{11} & s_{12} & \cdots & s_{1n}\\
s_{21} & s_{22} & \cdots & s_{2n}\\
\vdots & \vdots & \ddots & \vdots \\
s_{n1} & s_{n2} & \cdots & s_{nn}
\end{array}\right]\begin{array}{c}
T_{1}\\
T_{2}\\
\vdots \\
T_{n}
\end{array}\newline \hspace{0pt}\hspace{0pt}\hspace{0pt}\hspace{0pt}\hspace{0pt}\hspace{0pt}\hspace{0pt}\hspace{0pt}\hspace{0pt}\hspace{0pt}\hspace{0pt}\hspace{0pt}\hspace{0pt}\hspace{0pt}\hspace{0pt}\hspace{0pt}\hspace{0pt}\hspace{0pt}\hspace{0pt}\hspace{0pt}\hspace{0pt}\hspace{0pt}\hspace{0pt}\hspace{0pt}\begin{array}{cccc}
T_{1} & \hspace{0pt}\hspace{0pt}\hspace{0pt}T_{2} & \hspace{0pt}\hspace{0pt}\hspace{0pt}\cdots & T_{n}
\end{array}$	(3.3)

\raisebox{-6pt}{\$ d\_\{ i \}  j=2 \textasciicircum{} \{ 2 \} *b\_\{ M \}  D \textasciicircum{} \{ i \} j+2*b\_\{ M \}  S \textasciicircum{} \{ i \} j+b\_\{ M \}  B \textasciicircum{} \{ i \} j \$}
\begin{equation*}
d_{i}j=2^{2}*b_{M}D^{i}j+2*b_{M}S^{i}j+b_{M}B^{i}j
\end{equation*}
\raisebox{-2pt}{\$  \$}

\raisebox{-6pt}{\$ s\_\{ i \}  j=1-(1-(d\_\{ i \}  j)/3)e \textasciicircum{} \{ (-d\_\{ i \}  j) \}  \$}
